E9F8 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04748                     PSHU  D
E9FA BDE561           (    forth6809.asm):04749                     JSR   THROWW
E9FD CC0020           (    forth6809.asm):04750         PPSTOK:     LDD   #32
EA00 3606             (    forth6809.asm):04751                     PSHU  D
